            {
                "img": "https://arxiv.org/html/2608.29847/2608.29847v1/sec/plots/pi.png",
                "caption": "Figure 2:ContextBias workflow.From a set of roles,\nan LLM constructs semantically matched prompts across three contextual\nconditions: context-free (CF), context-related (CA-R), and\ncontext-unrelated (CA-U). T2I models generate images for each prompt\nand seed. A schema-guided vision-language pipeline extracts structured\nvisual attributes, which are aggregated, and calculates a Bias\nIntensity (BI) and the Context Consistency Score (CCS).",
                "position": 456
            }
        ]
